{"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A Guido Music Notation tag whose name GMN reserves but no typed payload"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"claims, carried in its untyped, as-written form."}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNReservedTag\/body","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNReservedTag\/ident-swift.property","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNReservedTag\/name-swift.property","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNReservedTag\/parameters"],"generated":true},{"anchor":"Type-Aliases","title":"Type Aliases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNReservedTag\/Ident-swift.typealias","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNReservedTag\/Name-swift.typealias","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNReservedTag\/Parameter"],"generated":true},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNReservedTag\/Equatable-Implementations"],"generated":true}],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/SQ","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s16SendableMetatypeP"]}],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GMNReservedTag","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","title":"GMNReservedTag","symbolKind":"struct","externalID":"s:7IvorGMN14GMNReservedTagV","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"IvorGMN"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"GMNReservedTag"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Tags","title":"Tags","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNCustomTag"],"generated":true}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNReservedTag"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivorgmn\/gmnreservedtag"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GMNReservedTag"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/UsingIvorGMN"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is the payload of "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/reserved(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", one of the two untyped"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lanes of the tag model: a name, an optional identifier, a flat list of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"parameters, and a body of scoped symbols. Nothing here is interpreted — the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"parameters are whatever was written, in the order they were written, bound"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to nothing."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"What-lands-here-and-for-how-long","text":"What lands here, and for how long"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Three names land here ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"permanently"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":", by decision rather than by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"omission: ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\port"},{"text":", which GMN reserves but treats as a no-op, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\DrHoos"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\DrRenz"},{"text":", which fall outside the 59-payload catalog. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"catalog is closed, so this set does not grow or shrink.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Everything else that lands here is "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"temporary, and lasts until the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"normalizer runs","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":". The parser never repairs and never discards, so a tag"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"whose parameters do not yet bind cleanly arrives here intact: an unknown","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"parameter, a raw identifier, a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"$variable"},{"text":", a unit on a slot that cannot","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"carry one, a value of the wrong type. ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" repairs each of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"those and re-runs promotion, which is why ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"a parsed score is less typed","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"than a normalized one","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"After ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/normalize(_:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" returns, the only names left on this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"lane are the three above and the ones a defect no repair could reach kept","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"off a typed lane. Staying here is what carries such a tag to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator","type":"reference"},{"text":", which reports it — see ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/Issue","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"What does not land here","anchor":"What-does-not-land-here"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A name GMN does not reserve at all is "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/custom(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":", not this."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The distinction is drawn where tags are built, by the parser, which tests"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the name and sends it down one lane or the other."}]},{"anchor":"Read-never-written","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Read, never written"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This payload has no public initializer. Every value of it comes from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNParser","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", and the reason is that its admission rule is "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"reservation","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rather than the three permanent names above: a lossless parser has to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"carry "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\beam<bogus=1>"},{"type":"text","text":" before the normalizer repairs it, so any rule"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"narrow enough to keep a hand-built score well formed would be too narrow"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for the parser. Rather than pick one and lose the other, the lane is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"readable but not constructible — a hand-built tag reaches its meaning"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"through a typed payload, or through "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNCustomTag","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for a name GMN does"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not reserve."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The three permanent residents are the price: none of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\port"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\DrHoos"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or "},{"code":"\\DrRenz","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" can be written into a hand-built score, though each still","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"round-trips a parsed one untouched.","type":"text"}]}]}],"references":{"doc://IvorGMN/documentation/IvorGMN":{"role":"collection","title":"IvorGMN","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ivorgmn","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A Guido Music Notation parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter.","type":"text"}]},"doc://IvorGMN/documentation/IvorGMN/GMNScore":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"GMNScore"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNScore","title":"GMNScore","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A parsed Guido Music Notation score."}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GMNScore"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivorgmn\/gmnscore"},"doc://IvorGMN/documentation/IvorGMN/GMNValidator/Issue":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Issue","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/Issue","title":"GMNValidator.Issue","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An issue found when validating a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNScore","isActive":true},{"type":